(29, 1, '[{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1g5_5_X7__WgBqBmkI-0Z5fomKhNqrLTB\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:21\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1eKvByfj8cuj5MfOYqPA0yc5ezgsKtpGv\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:27\"},{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1yWqJgYtNMKZ6HLxQPb15OnctbpvNIPrd\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:30\"},{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1cTNihpOflZDVbFRU8LltOggNzxBsbtMD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:33\"},{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1nIhi8BxSCON1l8QYI0LCVbIq2rV3epVH\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:37\"},{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1JSZxRt8C9saqF7sahwUc4rEL2NXOPrZg\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:42\"},{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image-8.jpg\",\"id\":\"1FKSHhqtioNrqG6eTtqoxRAH-0CZj5AAb\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:45\"},{\"name\":\"visitors-from-prairie-harvest-image.jpg\",\"id\":\"1EGUsSCji9kEVoMTCI6N_K09N61_80DNX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:19:48\"}]', 'Events', 'FBS Welcomes Visitors from Prairie Harvest Christian Life Centre', 'FBS-Welcomes-Visitors-from-Prairie-Harvest-Christian-Life-Centre', '2025-03-17', '<p>\nAt Frontline Business Solutions, we take pride in being a Christ-centered company, striving not only for excellence in our business operations but also for meaningful partnerships in ministry work. As part of our commitment to faith and service, we had the privilege of welcoming Ptr. Des Klingspon from Prairie Harvest Christian Life Centre in Yorkton, Saskatchewan, Canada, along with Bro. Stefan and Sis. Chrystal Bymak.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nOur weekly devotion serves as a cornerstone of our work culture, providing a moment to reflect, connect, and strengthen our faith as we begin the week. This gathering was made even more special by the presence of our esteemed guests, who shared words of wisdom and encouragement with our team.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nPtr. Klingspon delivered a powerful message based on Ephesians 1:16-20, reminding us of the immeasurable greatness of God’s power and the hope we have in Christ. His words encouraged us to remain steadfast in our faith and to recognize the divine strength available to us in our daily endeavors.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nFollowing this, Bro. Stefan Bymak shared from Philippians 2:3-4, emphasizing the importance of humility and considering others above ourselves. His message resonated deeply, aligning with our company’s values of servant leadership and collaboration.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nOur partnership with different churches, including through Philippine Frontline Ministries, is a testament to our mission of integrating faith into the workplace and community. We are grateful for the time, fellowship, and spiritual insights that Ptr. Klingspon and the Bymaks imparted during their visit. Their presence was a blessing, and we look forward to more opportunities to grow together in faith and service.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nAs we continue our journey as a company, we remain committed to upholding Christian values in all that we do—honoring God, serving others, and making a meaningful impact in both the marketplace and the ministry.\n</p>', '2025-03-24 14:19:17', '2025-03-24 14:24:04'),
(30, 1, '[{\"name\":\"twomilesTeamA_image.jpg\",\"id\":\"1qHNXfyFYzHwtaohZhCwrKA7TLFaPS2zM\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:29:35\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"tmteama_image.jpg\",\"id\":\"167uuAiU-NoCxV8CxnDLxquhtfpzvC2VW\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:29:38\"},{\"name\":\"tmteamb_image.jpg\",\"id\":\"1O_4BKTpDKq3u_EOk9c35__6oH7QWEZWD\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:29:41\"}]', 'Events', 'Two Miles Inc. Founder Hiro Isogawa Visits FBS for Annual  Accounting Team Engagement', 'Two-Miles-Inc.-Founder-Hiro-Isogawa-Visits-FBS-for-Annual -Accounting-Team-Engagement', '2025-03-14', '<div class=\"flex justify-center mb-6\">\n<img src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/tm_logo_dark.png\" alt=\"TM Logo\">\n</div>\n\n<p>\nFrontline Business Solutions (FBS) recently welcomed Hiro Isogawa, the esteemed founder of Two Miles Inc., for his annual visit to the accounting team. This visit has become a tradition, reinforcing the strong partnership between Two Miles Inc. and FBS, which continues to thrive through the outsourcing of essential accounting services, including bookkeeping, payroll, tax compliance, and administrative support, to the Philippines.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nHiro’s visit serves as an opportunity to connect with the growing workforce at FBS, recognizing their dedication and contributions to the success of Two Miles Inc. With the continuous expansion of the accounting team, this engagement is a valuable moment to align goals, discuss improvements, and explore strategies to further enhance the efficiency of outsourced accounting operations.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nDuring his visit, Hiro took the time to personally meet with the accounting professionals at FBS, expressing his appreciation for their hard work and commitment to delivering quality services. He also provided insights into the evolving needs of Two Miles Inc., ensuring that the collaboration remains productive and mutually beneficial.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nThe partnership between Two Miles Inc. and FBS continues to grow, reflecting the increasing demand for reliable and high-quality accounting services. By leveraging the expertise of FBS, Two Miles Inc. is able to maintain seamless financial operations, allowing them to focus on their core business objectives.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nAs FBS and Two Miles Inc. look forward to another year of successful collaboration, Hiro Isogawa’s visit stands as a testament to the trust and confidence he has in the team at FBS. His annual engagement not only strengthens professional ties but also motivates the entire accounting workforce to continue excelling in their roles, ensuring the sustained growth of both organizations.\n</p>\n', '2025-03-24 14:29:31', '2025-03-24 14:29:31'),
(31, 1, '[{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_9.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Igldh0MTO0REB-FfHeXboCVykQevKkIb\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:38:41\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_10.jpg\",\"id\":\"1hSHXFqL0J7g7crIMsoRFlGdKNMBZYN1I\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:38:49\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_11.jpg\",\"id\":\"1NJecmOZ3jx7iyVwuEl3QhonFx0yr4_dX\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:38:52\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_12.jpg\",\"id\":\"1P_jQagvo2Pu_iM52XXmuHSjz7-QmSiP-\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:38:55\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_13.jpg\",\"id\":\"1oaxLTrPZHiYKOBPoafFaeP9nhuBwNJe1\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:38:58\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_14.jpg\",\"id\":\"110FYEHR7mN35Bj3EKZkIJGwl_FZT6gVd\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:01\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_2.jpg\",\"id\":\"1I61m6oy1HwuJKiqoMlYSfAjLkYHps2VV\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:06\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_3.jpg\",\"id\":\"1QxhNGRk3CzlJehbIpnmEcLkfMn2jvhOp\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:09\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_4.jpg\",\"id\":\"1Z3InnQfYpOZNiqHgeFDsgiLLMLUVyuju\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:12\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_5.jpg\",\"id\":\"1jnCUuIa05JbtrpyCUrT9o3_l3ih-X0w_\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:15\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_6.jpg\",\"id\":\"1C9hzzknbuWj7pL-1OJJlXmJkPsB6e702\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:18\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_7.jpg\",\"id\":\"1lYArMdGsdd9D9RcwHE2ZwFs0KCLgVng0\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:22\"},{\"name\":\"sti_new_immersion_batch_image_8.jpg\",\"id\":\"1cuBXS19rLZ27swy4BHn6AUCQQlwQN4u3\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 14:39:25\"}]', 'Events', 'STI College San Pablo Kicks Off 80-Hour SHS Work Immersion in Web Design and Development', 'STI-College-Work-Immersion-Kicks-Off', '2025-03-12', '<div class=\"flex justify-center\">\n<img src=\"http://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/img/sti.png\" alt=\"STI Logo\">\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nSan Pablo City – Today marks the exciting start of STI College San Pablo’s Senior High School Work Immersion Program, where Grade 12 ICT students embark on an 80-hour hands-on learning experience in Web Design and Web Development. This initiative is designed to equip students with practical skills that bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world application.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nUnder the guidance of industry professionals, the students will delve into Web Designing using Figma, a leading design tool for user interface and user experience (UI/UX) development. Additionally, they will enhance their technical capabilities in Web Development by mastering HTML and CSS, essential technologies for building functional and aesthetically pleasing websites.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nA heartfelt thank you to Mrs. Guillerma Tajao, LPT, Assistant Principal, and Ms. Angelica Estipona, LPT, Work Immersion Coordinator, for their dedication in facilitating and supporting the students on their first day of immersion. Their commitment to student success ensures that these aspiring IT professionals gain meaningful and industry-relevant experience.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThis work immersion program reflects STI College San Pablo’s dedication to preparing students for the demands of the digital age. By integrating hands-on learning opportunities with academic instruction, students gain valuable insights into the world of web design and development, setting them on the path to future career success.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nWe look forward to seeing the incredible projects and innovations these students will create throughout their immersion journey!\n</p>', '2025-03-24 14:38:30', '2025-03-24 14:38:30'),
(32, 1, '[{\"name\":\"batch056-057-00.webp\",\"id\":\"15RFzbPrzgFj7ZxBAk4SNYICGNLtkf6lh\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:22\"}]', '[{\"name\":\"batch056-057-01.webp\",\"id\":\"1H7mo4RQnxoDfjg-WzR5HQbTvf8ghoPJ6\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:25\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-02.webp\",\"id\":\"1jVn2RzdW_Qx5Ee2Cq_uVA-Tf6TnN8K_j\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:28\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-03.webp\",\"id\":\"1oB15WoreEDosmdj1H9tKYS7L2oVdRnh9\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:31\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-04.webp\",\"id\":\"1f43PVveefaoo48xdesCxxs0YMXu7xPnI\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:33\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-05.webp\",\"id\":\"1f3HYCfADJNtgPEjMHmty-f_Aw7FVU_1x\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:37\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-06.webp\",\"id\":\"1F9NCGCydjDGvOE7G-0jxo_V0qpLliZd6\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:40\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-07.webp\",\"id\":\"1RKGbHuW8_nqPRDkE7I34Ue09sLiLKoU9\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:42\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-08.webp\",\"id\":\"1hUvweDEBjrAQLEXwSISiRlqhxyA-KX-p\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:46\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-10.webp\",\"id\":\"1YuXpBHailX_ugzHJo5hrvzwWbjtBMX2u\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:02:49\"},{\"name\":\"batch056-057-13.webp\",\"id\":\"19ImkVTZgZID3BmyVzRbuy_nByd_F8QRF\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-24 15:03:05\"}]', 'Events', 'SHS Work Immersion Successful Completion of San Pablo Colleges Students', 'San-Pablo-Colleges-Students-Immersion-Completion', '2025-03-08', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nSan Pablo Colleges recently celebrated the successful completion of its Senior High School Information and Communications Technology (ICT) Strand students’ work immersion program in the field of web design and development. This milestone marks a significant achievement in bridging academic learning with real-world industry experience.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nThe immersive training, conducted at Frontline Business Solutions, Inc., provided students with hands-on exposure to professional web development processes, equipping them with practical skills essential for their future careers. Throughout the program, students engaged in real-life projects, learning the intricacies of website creation, user interface design, and coding practices under the guidance of experienced mentors from Frontline Business Solutions.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nA special acknowledgment goes to Ms. Chelsea Lim, the school coordinator and adviser, whose dedication and coordination played a vital role in ensuring a smooth deployment of students into the work immersion program. Her efforts facilitated a seamless integration between San Pablo Colleges and Frontline Business Solutions, allowing students to gain meaningful industry experience in a supportive learning environment.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nFrontline Business Solutions takes pride in nurturing young talents and remains committed to providing opportunities that enhance the employability of aspiring ICT professionals. By offering practical training in web design and development, the company contributes to shaping the next generation of skilled professionals ready to meet the demands of the evolving digital landscape.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\nCongratulations to all the ICT Strand students for their hard work and dedication during the program. We look forward to seeing them excel in their future careers and make significant contributions to the field of technology!\n</p>', '2025-03-24 15:02:17', '2025-03-24 15:02:17');

